// Device code sign-ins
// Most people never use the device code flow, so each sign-in with it deserves a look. Device code
// phishing tricks a user into entering the attacker's code; Microsoft reported Storm-2372 doing this
// through fake meeting invitations in February 2025.
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1528 Steal Application Access Token
// Data: SigninLogs, AADNonInteractiveUserSignInLogs
// Tuning: exclude known users of the flow, such as meeting room devices.
// Response: if the user didn't expect it, revoke sessions and review what the token was used for.
union SigninLogs, AADNonInteractiveUserSignInLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| where AuthenticationProtocol == "deviceCode"
| project TimeGenerated, UserPrincipalName, ResultType, IPAddress, Location, AppDisplayName, UserAgent
| order by TimeGenerated desc
